# ── Secrets — NEVER commit (token lives here for release automation) ─────
.env
*.env
.env.*

# ── Build output (regenerated by PyInstaller from the .spec) ─────────────
/Pak-Rat.exe
/_internal/
/build/
/dist/
/_release/

# ── Release archives — host these as GitHub Release assets, not in-tree ──
*.zip

# ── Proprietary: Oodle is NEVER committed (RAD/Epic, non-redistributable) ─
# Everything else in vendor/ (repak, injector, texconv — all MIT/Apache) IS
# committed so this repo is the single clone-and-build source. Oodle is
# fetched on the user's own machine at first run; see core.ensure_oodle().
oo2core_*.dll

# ── relink runtime: relink.py now drives UAssetAPI.dll IN-PROCESS via pythonnet
#    (no more relink.exe apphost — that stub tripped AV). UAssetAPI.dll + deps are
#    still produced from tools/relink via `dotnet publish` (source IS committed);
#    the built runtime is bundled at PyInstaller time, not committed. ────────────
Pak-Rat/vendor/relink/
Pak-Rat/vendor/relink.exe

# ── vendor/dotnet: standard-layout .NET 8 runtime pythonnet hosts (coreclr) so
#    shipped users need no .NET install. Provisioned at build (copy a .NET 8
#    runtime's host/ + shared/), bundled by PyInstaller, not committed (~71MB). ──
Pak-Rat/vendor/dotnet/

# ── Bulky generated data we don't ship in source ────────────────────────
Pak-Rat/data/assets.txt
Pak-Rat/data/textures_clean.txt
Pak-Rat/data/meshes_clean.txt

# ── Build log ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_build.log

# ── Internal docs & stray branding — kept local, out of the public package ─
/V2_BACKLOG.md
/Pak-Rat/DESIGN_NOTES.md
/pak-rat_transparent.png

# ── Python caches ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# ── PyInstaller intermediates ───────────────────────────────────────────
*.spec.bak
*.toc
*.pkg
warn-*.txt
xref-*.html

# ── Editor / OS cruft ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
